diff --git a/docs/business-rules.md b/docs/business-rules.md
index 7a3126a..87a96bf 100644
--- a/docs/business-rules.md
+++ b/docs/business-rules.md
@@ -134,6 +134,13 @@ ## Multilingual
 
 Web interface and **totem API** responses must support multiple languages; business rules (priorities, queue labels) are configurable per entity with locale fallback.
 
+### Account e-mails
+
+The product speaks **pt-BR by default** (`APP_LOCALE=pt_BR`, fallback `en`, `APP_NAME=PegaFila`; pinned in `phpunit.xml` for tests). Account e-mails are Laravel's `ResetPassword` and `VerifyEmail` notifications, translated through `lang/pt_BR.json` and rendered with the `pegafila` mail theme (`resources/views/vendor/mail/html/themes/pegafila.css`, brand color `#0f7490`, set in `mail.markdown.theme`).
+
+- **Password reset (guests only):** `POST /forgot-password` (`password.email`, `throttle:6,1`) **always** answers with the `passwords.sent` status, so it never reveals whether an address has an account. `POST /reset-password` (`password.update`) requires token, e-mail and a password of at least 8 characters with letters, mixed case and numbers, confirmed; it rotates `remember_token`, fires `PasswordReset` and redirects to `/` with the status (until the login page exists).
+- **E-mail verification:** `GET /email/verify/{id}/{hash}` (`verification.verify`, `auth` + `signed` + throttled) verifies the logged-in user only when id and hash match that user (403 otherwise) and redirects to `/`.
+
 ## Technical References (implementation)
 
 - **Asaas:** subscriptions, webhooks, sandbox-first — document in `ai/skills/asaas/` when adding integration.
